WEBVTT

00:02.914 --> 00:04.381
Legend has it...

00:05.550 --> 00:08.348
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.687 --> 00:13.852
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.493 --> 00:20.453
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.812 --> 00:41.241
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.553 --> 00:47.355
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.893 --> 00:54.798
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.468 --> 01:00.234
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:00.338 --> 01:03.535
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:07.312 --> 01:14.377
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.552 --> 01:20.388
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:21.259 --> 01:28.461
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.733 --> 01:37.107
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.809 --> 01:39.470
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:49.220 --> 01:52.656
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

02:01.833 --> 02:05.166
More than ten years after
the Battle of Sekigahara...

02:05.737 --> 02:08.069
...though the nation was slowly
moving toward stability...

02:08.206 --> 02:11.403
...it had not lost the
scent of war in the air...

02:12.310 --> 02:15.905
And there were still those who
had inherited the Art of Carnage...

02:31.062 --> 02:32.859
No good, no good!

02:32.964 --> 02:34.056
Damn stomach.

02:38.136 --> 02:39.569
All right, I hear you!

02:40.238 --> 02:41.830
Hey, Grandma, I need food!

02:42.040 --> 02:43.598
Yes, sir, right away!

02:48.747 --> 02:51.113
My, my! I've never seen the likes of this!

02:51.282 --> 02:56.584
He's putting away that barley rice
like it was the best thing he ever ate!

02:56.788 --> 02:59.256
I guess he must be starving.

03:04.395 --> 03:05.362
That was good!

03:06.030 --> 03:06.962
Seconds, please!

03:25.216 --> 03:26.945
Yes, sir, here you go!

03:27.585 --> 03:28.745
Thank you.

03:34.492 --> 03:35.516
Y-Young Master?

03:38.263 --> 03:39.992
Have they come this way?

03:49.474 --> 03:51.442
You certainly made a fast getaway...

03:51.609 --> 03:53.008
...but you ran out of luck!

03:55.480 --> 03:58.244
Please, you must help him!

04:01.085 --> 04:01.949
Please!

04:10.628 --> 04:11.652
Who the hell are you?

04:11.763 --> 04:13.355
If you don't butt out
right now, we'll kill you!

04:15.500 --> 04:17.627
Kill me?

04:19.370 --> 04:21.668
Do you know who you're dealing with?

04:25.643 --> 04:30.580
I'm just passing through, I know
nothing of this young man here.

04:31.216 --> 04:35.050
And I have no intention of crossing
swords with such unworthy opponents.

04:35.386 --> 04:38.617
But the thing is, I can't
just stand by and watch.

04:38.756 --> 04:39.552
What the hell?

04:41.726 --> 04:44.024
I'm only going to say this once!

04:44.329 --> 04:46.058
You're in way over your heads...

04:46.164 --> 04:48.496
...so why don't you put away your
swords and get the hell out of here!

04:48.733 --> 04:49.961
How dare you!

05:07.652 --> 05:08.380
Powerful!

05:19.764 --> 05:20.924
Oh, no you don't!

05:21.032 --> 05:22.329
This rice is mine!

05:22.634 --> 05:23.623
That little squirt...

05:23.902 --> 05:25.096
What the hell are you looking at?

05:33.945 --> 05:35.845
You still haven't
learned your lesson, huh?

05:35.947 --> 05:36.879
All right then!

05:51.629 --> 05:53.494
Hey, watch what you're doing!

05:53.631 --> 05:55.929
There are people eating here...

05:57.936 --> 06:00.234
Hey, kid, fight with me!

06:00.805 --> 06:01.430
Why?

06:01.773 --> 06:03.297
Because you're strong.

06:03.408 --> 06:06.241
I can tell that you're
strong, that's why.

06:07.578 --> 06:10.046
He's wrong, that man's nothing but an idiot.

06:13.117 --> 06:14.084
What's the matter?

06:14.585 --> 06:16.849
You're not just wearing
that sword for show, are you?

06:17.088 --> 06:18.851
Oh, you mean this?

06:19.190 --> 06:21.954
This is a carving knife.
I use it as a hatchet, too.

06:22.260 --> 06:23.693
It's pretty sharp, so it comes in handy!

06:36.040 --> 06:39.771
I guess I'll have to
wait until next time.

06:39.944 --> 06:44.108
You're the first one who's ever
looked into my eyes and laughed.

06:44.549 --> 06:45.311
Thank you.

06:50.054 --> 06:51.419
Thank you for coming to my aid.

06:51.522 --> 06:53.046
Would you mind telling me your name?

07:00.131 --> 07:01.393
I have a favor to ask of you...

07:01.499 --> 07:02.989
Jii! Thank goodness you're safe.

07:03.534 --> 07:06.867
I know I haven't even thanked you
properly yet for saving the young master...

07:06.971 --> 07:08.939
I hope you don't mind my asking...

07:09.374 --> 07:12.901
It's obvious that you
are a master swordsman.

07:13.111 --> 07:16.376
Please, if you could lend your skills
to the protection of the young master...

07:16.481 --> 07:17.209
Jii...

07:17.582 --> 07:20.608
As you can see, there are people
who want the young master dead.

07:20.752 --> 07:22.185
Please, if you could help us...

07:22.520 --> 07:25.978
Are you asking me to
become his bodyguard?

07:26.257 --> 07:28.282
Yes, if you would so honor us...

07:28.526 --> 07:30.357
I am a swordsman.

07:30.695 --> 07:33.926
I'm not in the business of
dispatching worthless scoundrels.

07:34.098 --> 07:35.531
You were in luck today.

07:36.401 --> 07:37.959
Sir, I beg you to reconsider!

07:39.904 --> 07:44.398
If you need a bodyguard, you should
hire that youngster over there.

07:44.542 --> 07:47.010
He might even do a
better job than I would.

07:51.416 --> 07:53.646
Kid, what's your name?

07:56.120 --> 07:57.109
Yakumo Mutsu!

07:58.056 --> 08:00.889
My name is Musashi Miyamoto!

08:02.693 --> 08:03.819
So he's Musashi...

08:04.462 --> 08:06.555
I'm sure our paths will cross again.

08:06.697 --> 08:08.562
And when they do, Yakumo Mutsu...

08:08.866 --> 08:10.800
...I'm going to wipe
that grin off your face!

08:16.641 --> 08:18.199
Mr. Mutsu, was it?

08:18.309 --> 08:20.607
Since you come so highly recommended
by the great Musashi himself...

08:20.845 --> 08:24.804
...I'd be honored if you'd take on the
role of protecting the young master!

08:25.016 --> 08:26.313
Bodyguard?

08:26.751 --> 08:28.218
Well, what the hell...

08:29.087 --> 08:30.076
Do you have any money?

08:30.588 --> 08:31.987
I have about 100 ryo, sir...

08:32.557 --> 08:34.388
Oh, I don't need that much.

08:34.725 --> 08:36.625
If you could just pay my lunch bill...

08:38.629 --> 08:40.062
How much for this man's lunch?

08:40.364 --> 08:41.854
That will be five mon, sir.

08:41.999 --> 08:45.765
Is he really going to sell
his life for a mere five mon?

08:53.077 --> 08:58.037
<i>A Man Like a Cloud</i>

09:08.860 --> 09:14.924
Young Master, I have no doubt in my
mind that your uncle wishes you dead.

09:15.433 --> 09:18.334
Please, you must stop taking
these walks in the mountains...

09:18.536 --> 09:21.334
Am I to keep myself hidden
in the house like a girl?

09:21.472 --> 09:22.939
Please forgive me!

09:23.407 --> 09:25.341
If you are to survive, yes!

09:25.443 --> 09:27.377
Let us put an end to this charade...

09:27.512 --> 09:31.039
You must tell him that you wish to
withdraw from this succession dispute!

09:31.149 --> 09:32.081
Shut up!

09:32.583 --> 09:37.213
My uncle poisoned his own brother
so he could take over our clan...

09:37.321 --> 09:39.585
You really think I should hand
everything over to such a man?

09:39.957 --> 09:44.155
Are you telling me to forget about
avenging my father, and also my mother...

09:44.262 --> 09:45.559
...who died giving birth to me?

09:47.398 --> 09:49.423
I am an old man now.

09:49.600 --> 09:53.195
I'm no longer up to the task of
protecting you from being killed!

09:56.207 --> 09:58.198
And so you decided to hire him?

09:58.309 --> 10:00.470
He was highly recommended
by the great Musashi...

10:00.878 --> 10:02.345
Recommended, my foot!

10:02.680 --> 10:06.138
What did he call his sword?
A carving knife, a hatchet!

10:06.284 --> 10:08.946
Musashi just wanted to get out
of accepting the job himself.

10:09.153 --> 10:10.120
But...

10:10.321 --> 10:14.951
There are times when the
impassive can appear to be masters.

10:15.393 --> 10:19.420
Musashi is a master himself,
that's why he misjudged this man.

10:19.997 --> 10:20.929
Just look at him!

10:21.098 --> 10:22.929
The first thing he
does is sit in the sun!

10:23.701 --> 10:26.568
No man in his right mind
would sell his life for five mon.

10:26.737 --> 10:28.466
Jii, bring me my bokuto!

10:28.573 --> 10:29.369
Young Master...

10:30.741 --> 10:31.332
I want to test him.

10:34.145 --> 10:35.476
Hey...

10:48.292 --> 10:50.226
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

10:50.628 --> 10:51.856
Man, that hurt!

10:51.963 --> 10:53.021
What's the big idea?

10:53.831 --> 10:55.526
I don't believe this guy...

10:56.367 --> 10:57.459
You idiot!

10:57.935 --> 10:59.800
I thought you could do better than that!

11:09.280 --> 11:13.649
We want you to assassinate Kisshoumaru,
the only child of the previous Lord.

11:14.252 --> 11:19.246
If only he'd been born a woman, but
we can't let any male heirs live.

11:20.558 --> 11:22.651
First his own brother,
and now his nephew...

11:23.060 --> 11:23.890
Hey!

11:24.028 --> 11:25.689
You better watch your mouth.

11:25.863 --> 11:27.125
You are in His Lordship's presence.

11:27.398 --> 11:28.990
You have nothing to worry about.

11:29.133 --> 11:32.660
I will send the Young Master
to his death, just as you wish.

11:33.204 --> 11:36.765
The problem is, it looks as
though you'll have to fight...

11:36.874 --> 11:37.772
Musashi, is it?

11:41.579 --> 11:44.480
The man who defeated Seijuro Yoshioka...

11:44.649 --> 11:47.049
...the Master of the
Yoshioka School of Kendo...

11:48.586 --> 11:53.353
He then killed Denshichiro Yoshioka
when he tried to avenge his brother...

11:56.093 --> 11:58.220
And finally took on all
of the Yoshioka students...

11:58.329 --> 12:01.264
...when they attacked in the name
of Seijuro's young son Matashichiro.

12:01.365 --> 12:05.426
Even outnumbered he managed to
cut down every last one of them!

12:05.670 --> 12:08.332
Today he's known as the
greatest swordsman in the land...

12:08.439 --> 12:10.270
...or should I call him the "Sword Demon?"

12:14.578 --> 12:17.672
It seems that Musashi has
aligned himself with Kisshoumaru...

12:17.782 --> 12:20.580
Isn't that why you're turning
to the Yagyu clan for help?

12:21.085 --> 12:25.351
Whether it's Musashi or not, he is not
an enemy of the Yagyu Shinkage Style.

12:33.931 --> 12:34.863
Are you a ninja?

12:35.333 --> 12:36.163
That is correct, sir.

12:38.569 --> 12:42.096
Are you implying that I cannot
defeat Musashi on my own?

12:42.206 --> 12:46.643
N-No, he was hired only to investigate...

12:47.445 --> 12:50.972
Listen to me, I, Hyoma Yagyu,
will be the one to kill Musashi!

13:06.097 --> 13:09.999
I'd like to know what that man is up to.

13:17.241 --> 13:18.640
Just look at that moon...

13:33.524 --> 13:34.548
Hey, listen...

13:37.094 --> 13:37.617
Hey.

13:38.162 --> 13:38.821
Hey!

13:39.330 --> 13:41.161
Shut up, you're disrupting me!

13:41.265 --> 13:42.823
What's up with you, anyway?

13:43.234 --> 13:45.725
Following me around everyday!

13:46.036 --> 13:48.800
Well, that's because I'm your bodyguard.

13:50.141 --> 13:51.005
Idiot!

13:51.242 --> 13:53.142
Who are you trying to fool,
when you have no skills?

13:53.711 --> 13:56.077
I can take care of myself, thank you!

13:56.180 --> 13:57.272
It doesn't become you.

13:57.381 --> 13:58.109
What?

13:58.315 --> 13:59.782
It doesn't become you...

14:00.151 --> 14:02.085
It's too bad, because
you're really a beauty.

14:03.354 --> 14:04.548
A-A beauty?

14:04.989 --> 14:05.921
How dare you!

14:06.257 --> 14:08.418
Calling a man a beauty!

14:08.859 --> 14:11.487
What are you talking about?
You're a girl, aren't you?

14:14.231 --> 14:15.061
I-I'm...

14:15.266 --> 14:15.994
Dammit!

14:16.133 --> 14:17.293
I'm a man!

14:17.401 --> 14:19.164
If you insult me again I'll kill you!

14:19.403 --> 14:21.769
As if any guy could
really look that hot...

14:22.406 --> 14:23.430
First of all...

14:23.574 --> 14:24.598
W-What the hell?

14:25.943 --> 14:27.205
You smell different.

14:27.578 --> 14:28.408
See...

14:30.881 --> 14:32.872
That's a man's smell.

14:37.988 --> 14:39.751
You see? Totally different.

14:41.659 --> 14:43.217
You smell really good!

14:53.737 --> 14:58.071
Try pulling something like that
again, and I really will kill you!

15:01.245 --> 15:02.940
Ow...

15:04.515 --> 15:06.415
Insolent fool!

15:08.319 --> 15:09.547
Gohei, I'm going riding!

15:10.287 --> 15:11.117
What?

15:11.589 --> 15:13.250
Oh, you mustn't, Young Master!

15:13.390 --> 15:15.654
Matabei says that you are
not to leave the grounds...

15:17.495 --> 15:19.087
Lord Kisshoumaru!

15:19.797 --> 15:20.786
Young Master!

15:24.502 --> 15:26.834
I never thought he would
leave the grounds.

15:27.104 --> 15:30.096
I figured I was going to have
to find a way to lure him out...

15:30.708 --> 15:33.609
Does that young master want to die?

15:50.561 --> 15:51.926
A beauty, he called me...

15:52.663 --> 15:53.755
Me!

15:54.231 --> 15:55.323
Could it be?

16:01.472 --> 16:03.804
Dammit, I'm a man!

16:04.308 --> 16:06.606
No man would tolerate
being called a beauty!

16:07.811 --> 16:11.076
Princess, you must go
back to being a woman.

16:11.248 --> 16:13.716
I don't want to hear
that kind of rubbish!

16:13.817 --> 16:15.375
I am Kisshoumaru!

16:15.619 --> 16:18.315
You're the one who said
you'd give your life to...

16:18.422 --> 16:20.583
...restore me to the
leadership of the clan!

16:23.994 --> 16:25.325
I am a man.

16:25.429 --> 16:28.865
I've become a man so that I
can avenge my dead parents!

16:30.301 --> 16:31.700
It doesn't become you...

16:31.902 --> 16:33.870
It's too bad, because
you're really a beauty.

16:45.950 --> 16:47.440
I can't deceive them anymore...

16:48.152 --> 16:50.245
If only I'd been born a man...

17:20.217 --> 17:21.013
Who's there?

17:23.621 --> 17:24.246
It's me.

17:26.123 --> 17:28.853
I'm going to get dressed,
so look the other way!

17:30.060 --> 17:30.958
You can turn around now.

17:32.796 --> 17:34.127
Y-You saw me, didn't you?

17:35.199 --> 17:36.496
Yes, I'm afraid I saw everything!

17:38.202 --> 17:40.466
I was going to call out to you...

17:40.871 --> 17:43.135
...but you looked so pretty
you had me in a trance!

17:43.641 --> 17:44.437
Pretty?

17:44.541 --> 17:45.439
Me?

17:45.843 --> 17:48.004
It really is a damned waste.

17:48.345 --> 17:51.280
You having to wear
those masculine clothes...

17:51.582 --> 17:52.549
Shut up!

17:53.017 --> 17:54.917
You better not tell anybody about this.

17:55.986 --> 17:58.216
What was your name again?

17:58.555 --> 18:00.785
I-I've already told
you, it's Kisshoumaru!

18:00.958 --> 18:03.017
No, I meant your real name.

18:04.161 --> 18:06.026
The only name I answer
to is Kisshoumaru!

18:06.196 --> 18:08.858
It was my mother who named me that!

18:15.439 --> 18:17.100
Looks like they've arrived.

18:17.608 --> 18:19.371
What's going on?

18:19.677 --> 18:23.078
Let's see, there must
be at least 10 of them...

18:41.532 --> 18:45.628
I see His Lordship has
no faith in my skills!

18:46.003 --> 18:47.766
Why did you send so many men?

18:48.005 --> 18:51.202
We mustn't forget that we're
up against the great Musashi...

18:51.809 --> 18:54.175
Who wouldn't be afraid
to confront him?

18:54.945 --> 18:56.640
What do you mean, Musashi?

18:57.548 --> 18:59.038
Who the hell is that little squirt?

18:59.216 --> 19:00.774
Are you saying that's Musashi?

19:01.418 --> 19:08.324
I did report that I saw no sign of
Musashi at the Young Master's home.

19:10.594 --> 19:11.424
Run!

19:12.763 --> 19:14.594
I'm the one they're after.

19:19.002 --> 19:19.900
Hey!

19:20.137 --> 19:21.729
It's all right, just stand back...

19:22.439 --> 19:23.201
Fool!

19:23.574 --> 19:25.371
Don't show off when
you're not even competent!

19:25.709 --> 19:27.370
You want to throw away
your life for five mon?

19:30.781 --> 19:32.214
Don't worry...

19:32.683 --> 19:34.776
I'm not going to do more
than five mon's worth of work...

19:35.552 --> 19:38.020
Unbelievable, he's going to attack!

19:38.122 --> 19:39.089
That little punk!

19:40.224 --> 19:41.486
Where are you going?

19:41.625 --> 19:42.489
I'm leaving.

19:42.593 --> 19:45.221
You don't need me, since
we're not taking on Musashi.

19:54.438 --> 19:55.234
They'll kill you!

20:17.461 --> 20:19.952
That's about two mon, wouldn't you say?

20:23.133 --> 20:23.929
What?

20:24.201 --> 20:27.136
Did Yakumo actually defeat those men?

20:27.237 --> 20:29.398
How the hell did he...

20:29.673 --> 20:30.469
What's wrong?

20:30.574 --> 20:31.506
Is it over?

20:32.276 --> 20:34.210
What happened, hey ninja!

20:34.545 --> 20:36.206
Those moves...

20:44.655 --> 20:47.988
I am backing out of this assignment.

20:48.325 --> 20:50.384
That man cannot be defeated.

20:50.794 --> 20:52.489
A word of advice to you...

20:52.729 --> 20:55.721
Lord Yagyu, you should
walk away from this as well.

20:55.833 --> 20:56.356
What the hell?

20:57.000 --> 20:59.833
If I've guessed right...

21:00.504 --> 21:02.734
...that man is from the Mutsu family.

21:02.940 --> 21:03.804
Mutsu?

21:04.842 --> 21:07.811
All I know is from
the legends I've heard...

21:08.245 --> 21:12.773
...the hidden martial
art, Mutsu Enmei Style!

21:18.689 --> 21:21.749
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.903 --> 21:44.940
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:45.215 --> 21:54.954
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:55.092 --> 22:04.091
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:04.234 --> 22:14.906
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.946 --> 22:22.078
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.452 --> 22:25.444
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:26.323 --> 22:32.592
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.896 --> 22:38.391
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:53.016 --> 22:54.210
Mutsu Enmei Style...

22:54.318 --> 22:57.082
So many master swordsmen
have been drawn to its power.

22:57.354 --> 23:00.790
And now Hyoma Yagyu of the Ura-Yagyu
clan is closing in on Yakumo.

23:01.291 --> 23:04.852
Next episode of the Age of
Chaos, "A Fighter Without Peer."

23:05.128 --> 23:06.789
Pay close attention, and wait!
